Carquet 5c3532831090a934315abf66dddb13c3219cb4d2: fix multi-batch
PLAIN BOOLEAN and BYTE_STREAM_SPLIT page encoding.
Upstream issues: https://github.com/Vitruves/carquet/issues/24
                 https://github.com/Vitruves/carquet/issues/25
The callback additions route random-access reads and sequential writes through
NeuG InputStream/OutputStream, with exactly-once close or abort ownership.
Remove each change when the pinned upstream version provides its equivalent
and the multibatch and I/O adapter regression tests pass without that change.

