+/* ============================================================================
+ * Callback I/O
+ * ============================================================================
+ *
+ * Callback streams let embedders route Parquet I/O through their own VFS.
+ * Carquet copies the callback table and takes ownership of the context once an
+ * open call is made. A reader invokes close exactly once, including when
+ * opening fails. Callbacks must not call back into the same reader.
+ */
